actions toward various items and animals - exceptions.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:99.0pt;text-indent:-1.5in'><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>               7.12.525      Construction,
installation, placement, erection of structure , improvement, landscaping or
obstruction prohibited - exceptions.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:99.0pt;text-indent:-1.5in'><span
