waste, yard waste, rubbish, refuse prohibitions - exceptions.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:99.0pt;text-indent:-1.5in'><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>               7.12.545      Aircraft,
model aircraft, model planes, rockets, drones prohibited - exceptions - kites
and decorative balloons allowed - exceptions.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:99.0pt;text-indent:-1.5in'><span
